    "title"            "PZRC Mod"
    "description"      "Standalone server-side toolkit for PZ B42 Multiplayer: starter kit crate, ration fridge, dynamic radio events, library, infinite generator, fuel pump refill, and a welcome note. All logic ships inside the mod — no manual file drops to ~/Zomboid/Lua/ required."

    "changenote"       "0.4.1 — Fix nested-container loophole: a non-owner could open a backpack lying in a claimed vehicle's trunk and pull items out because the transfer-block only checked the direct container's vehicle, not nested ones. Now walks the container chain (container -> containingItem -> item:getContainer() -> ...) so bag-in-bag-in-trunk is fully covered. Same fix applied to the OnContainerUpdate UI-close path. // 0.4.0 — Safe-zone vehicle-claim (sandbox EnableVehicleClaim, default OFF): vehicles crossing into the SZ are auto-claimed for their current driver+passengers by SteamID; non-owners cannot enter, smash, hotwire, siphon, repair, lock, refuel, attach/detach trailer, or open containers. Damage protection (snapshot+revert) reverts hits from non-owners within 5 tiles. Library Place Item blocked. Abandoned-vehicle event: PickUpTruck loot fixed, police car removed. FuelPump min 5000 -> 500."

